<title>GEORGIA: TENNIS-SLOVENIA LEAD GEORGIA 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SLOVENIA LEAD GEORGIA 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>TBILISI 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenia beat Georgia 3-2 in their</p>
<p>Davis Cup Euro/African zone group two, first round tie on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>Results of Sunday's singles matches (Slovenian names first):</p>
<p>Borut Urh beat Vladimir Margalitadze 6-2 6-2 6-0</p>
<p>Andrei Krasevec lost to Vladimir Gabrichidze 6-4 6-7 2-6</p>
</text>
